WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
No one has ever drilled more than
a tiny fraction of the way to

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.490
the centre of the Earth.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.750
Nobody has ever been
anywhere near its core.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.450
Yet we are sure that the outer
part of the core is liquid.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.770
So how can we know what's down there?

6
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.150
In this mission, you'll meet the
two kinds of seismic wave that

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.170
earthquakes send through the
Earth: P waves and S waves.

8
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.090
You'll find out which is longitudinal
and which is transverse,

9
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.730
and what each one can travel through.

10
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:33.210
Your mission: find out how we
know the outer core is liquid.
